time they get turned wrong because they don't know the language.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T19:13:59-07:00","id":219738,"title":"","content":"You've got to watch <i>Postal </i>while shitfaced. You might want to watch some of Ewe Bolls lesser films, which are all adapting various videogames, very badly.<br /> But <i>Postal</i> is the goddamn apex of it. If only for the brilliant Cameo Scene featuring him and Vince Desiderio (CEO of the company that created the games the movie is based on.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T20:53:30-07:00","id":219812,"title":"","content":"Played a Harry Potter movie drinking game once. I don't remember the exact rules, but I remember it was Prisoner of Azkaban and you drank for things like Hermione raising her hand, and people mentioning Harry's eyes. I was the only person who got through the whole movie, and I have never puked so much before or since.<br /> <br /> I also once watched Moulin Rouge and drank every time they said (or sang) the word &quot;love&quot;. With absinthe. That was a good night.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T07:34:40-07:00","id":220188,"title":"","content":"My friends and I watched Tremors while &quot;drunk&quot;. It was amazing!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1006-widdershawns","name":"widdershawns","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1006_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"87"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T08:34:06-07:00","id":220242,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>widdershawns</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/217970-movies-to-watch-while-drunk?p=220188#post220188\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My friends and I watched Tremors while &quot;drunk&quot;. It was amazing!!</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, didn't think of that one.....good choice. You can spend a night getting plastered and watch all of them. Since they get progressively sillier, it works out nicely.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T10:22:50-07:00","id":220323,"title":"","content":"Not a movie, but the show Deadwood. Take a shot every time someone says &quot;cocksucker&quot;. <a href=\"http://youtu.be/j1VFMy_uHVg?t=1m59s\" target=\"_blank\">This scene</a> alone is worth 12 shots.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ortam + Malkavia makes a Requiem fun.<br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Posts in this colour are Persuasion.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\">Posts in this colour are Seduction.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this colour are Intimidation.</span>","edited":{"userid":57,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/57-solomon-birch","user":"solomon birch","date":". 08-06-2014, 01:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/57-solomon-birch","name":"solomon birch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar57_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"289"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T23:39:28-07:00","id":220772,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>widdershawns</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/217970-movies-to-watch-while-drunk?p=220188#post220188\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My friends and I watched Tremors while &quot;drunk&quot;. It was amazing!!</div> </div> </div> </div>See? I hang out with all the wrong peoples! GRABOIDS FOR THE WIN!<br /> YOU ARE HEREBY INVITED TO A HYPOTHETICAL WEDDING I MIGHT HAVE TO A HYPOTHETICAL LOVE INTEREST!<br /> <br /> Oh, and<br /> <br /> Gremlins.<br /> <br /> Fucking Gremlins, man. Watch. Drink. Laugh at hilariously depressing Santa Claus stories, while green hooligans go apeshit on a small town! Drink every time you witness gremlin-based debauchery or mischief!<br /> <br /> EDIT: If you're watching Gremlins II: The New Batch, then I recommend drinking whenever Gizmo does something smart, conscientious or badass.<br /> Seriously, if you try it with Gremlins 1 rules, you'll get too drunk to piss anywhere but where you're laying. Trust Gizmo.<br /> <br /> There's more. I'm not drunk enough yet. Lemme get back to you guys with more.<br /> <br /> I finally found my niche.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 08-07-2014, 02:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-08T19:41:35-07:00","id":222720,"title":"","content":"- Mallrats, Clerks, Dogma, etc. Anything before Kevin Smith started working with Liv Tyler and randomly inserting his own wife into his films. Also, Chasing Amy can make drunk nerds cry spontaneously. Just a warning.<br /> Drink whenever the main character complains. Shots while Silent Bob is talking.<br /> <br /> - The Evil Dead series, because duh. Drink to fight the minions of darkness!<br /> <br /> - The Child's Play and Robocop trilogies. No rehashes, remakes or silly sequels! HE NEVER NEEDED THAT AMULET BEFORE!!!!<br /> Drink whenever somebody dies. Shots whenever someone comes back from the dead in a new body<br /> <br /> - American Psycho, for when you're feeling sloshed and sanguine. Drink whenever Patrick Bateman says something violent or kills someone. <br /> <br /> - HACKERS. It might be dated as hell, and inaccurate as balls, but Ooooh Pretty. Drink whenever you wish you were there, or whenever a favorite character does something fun or helpful. I'm going to go get some more coffee.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":380,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","user":"AzraelFirestorm","date":". 08-08-2014, 10:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-08T22:21:41-07:00","id":222823,"title":"","content":"- Conan the Barbarian. *Drink whenever Conan unsheathes his sword or kills someone. *<br /> <br /> - Red Sonja. *Drink whenever Red disparages the male gender, or whenever the young Prince starts mouthing off like a big kid.*<br /> <br /> - Dune. Drink whenever someone says Muad'Dib or Kwisatz Haderach. If you're a heavier drinker or perfectly legal pot smoker, drink/smoke whenever you hear the word &quot;spice&quot; or whenever you see sand and/or stillsuits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:times new roman\"><span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><b>\u201cNobody is purely good or purely evil. Mo</b></span><b>st of us are in-between. There are moths that explore the day and butterflies that play at night.\u201d </b><br /> - Suzy Kassem, Rise Up and Salute The Sun<br /> <b>(She/Her)</b></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/380-azraelfirestorm","name":"AzraelFirestorm","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar380_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-08T22:26:17-07:00","id":222827,"title":"","content":"...and I know it's not a movie, but...<br /> <br /> FLCL * Drink whenever